Package: mvtnormfast
Title: Fast Multivariate Normal Rectangle Probabilities for Structured Covariance
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Peter", "Cotton", email = "peter.cotton@microprediction.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Drop-in accelerator for mvtnorm::pmvnorm() on the structured
    slice: when the covariance is (or is supplied as) factor plus diagonal,
    rectangle probabilities reduce to a low-dimensional factor integral of a
    product of univariate normal CDFs, evaluated deterministically in
    milliseconds at dimensions where general-purpose quadrature needs
    seconds to minutes. The method is described in Cotton (2026)
    <doi:10.2139/ssrn.7307363>, extending the factor-conditioning
    quadrature of Butler and Moffitt (1982) <doi:10.2307/1912613>. Dense
    unstructured covariances fall back to mvtnorm::pmvnorm() unchanged.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Imports: mvtnorm, stats
Suggests: testthat
Encoding: UTF-8
